    "faq_nTGrbh": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_HGcBzh": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "How often should I calibrate my breathalyser?",
            "text": "<p>You are recommended to calibrate your breathalyser every 12 months regardless of the number of uses. This is to maintain its accuracy and prolong its lifespan. Additionally, regular calibration can extend the warranty of your breathalyser under the <a href=\"/pages/guarantee\" title=\"Andatech Lifetime Guarantee\">Andatech Guarantee</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_ifqgCf": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Can I book a one-off calibration instead?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, you can manually book your breathalyser calibration on <a href=\"https://andatech.caltrace.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Caltrace</a>. However, we highly recommend that you check out our <a href=\"/pages/calibration-and-servicing\" title=\"Calibration and Servicing\">calibration management plans</a> that can save you time and money compared to regular calibrations.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_zUjpND": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "What is the process of sending a breathalyser back for calibration?",
            "text": "<p>The steps below apply if you've already paid for return shipping or are on a calibration plan. If you haven't booked your calibration yet, please <a href=\"https://andatech.caltrace.com/\" target=\"_blank\">book it here</a> first.</p><ol><li>Pack your breathalyser securely in a padded parcel bag or box after removing all its accessories.</li><li>Print and attach the return label that you received through email. </li><li>Drop your breathalyser off over an Australia Post counter and get a lodgement receipt.</li><li>Wait for your breathalyser to be calibrated and mailed back to you.</li></ol>"
          }
        },
        "question_y7Y6BQ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Do I get the Andatech Guarantee if my breathalyser is calibrated regularly?",
            "text": "<p>Yes! Your Andatech breathalyser is entitled to the guarantee if calibrated every 12 months.</p><p>Learn more about the <a href=\"https://andatech.com.au/pages/guarantee\" title=\"Andatech Guarantee\">Andatech Guarantee</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_iW7id7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Do you provide training for breathalyser usage?",
            "text": "<p>Yes! We provide online training for <a href=\"/products/online-training-for-andatech-surety\" title=\"Online Training for Andatech Surety\">Andatech Surety</a> and <a href=\"/products/online-training-for-andatech-prodigy-s\" title=\"Online Training for Andatech Prodigy S\">Prodigy S</a>. If you have questions on using other breathalysers, you can get in touch with our Support team. </p>"
          }
        },
        "question_RdY9Mz": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Do you provide trade-in deals for your breathalysers?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, we offer trade-in deals for breathalysers. You can trade-in your old breathalyser of any brand and condition, to a brand new one from us at a special price. </p><p>Check out our <a href=\"/pages/breathalyser-trade-in\" title=\"Breathalyser trade-in\">breathalyser trade-in</a> page for the latest offers.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
